## Tweet 1/1

@Zooko and the Zcash team were **decades** ahead. While academia debated if practical ZK was even possible, they shipped shielded transactions to mainnet in 2016.

Sergey's "this shouldn't work" reaction? That's the gut feeling most of us had. The math is so elegant it feels like cheating physics.

The real lesson: Build while they doubt. Pioneer while they theorize.

[Quote tweet: https://x.com/will__mcevoy/status/2057814434915991579]"}
